%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant CF as CloudFront + WAF
  participant ALB as ALB
  participant MW as Next.js middleware.ts
  participant R as API route.ts
  participant G as Workspace guard /<br/>execution scope / place
  participant X as Regional AWS client
  B->>CF: HTTPS (page or /api/*)
  CF->>ALB: origin request (security group allows only the CloudFront prefix list)
  ALB->>MW: request
  MW->>MW: verify Cognito ID token (jose + remote JWKS)<br/>exceptions: /api/public/* ·<br/>internal endpoints check the origin header<br/>
  MW-->>B: 401 / 503 (service refused when auth is not configured)
  MW->>R: pass ⇒ enter route
  R->>G: requireProject / guardResourceAccess (workspace membership)
  R->>G: read APIs readScope(?scope=) · write APIs placeOfRequest(targetId)
  G-->>R: 400 InvalidScope / 409 cross-region read / place unavailable ⇒ reject
  R->>X: client for that region by place (target-clients.ts)
  X-->>R: DynamoDB / Redshift Data API / Glue / Athena / S3 Tables …
  R->>R: write operations<br/>recorded in bgp-audit<br/>
  R-->>B: apiOk / apiError unified response
